title: Modernisation of Agriculture
subtitle: Agriculture: advisers, consolidation of land, cooperatives.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_agriculture.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'agriculture_development') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.agriculture_development (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.9). Opening and closing the card
// are free; a confirmed option costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser who opened the card. Z — 0.97 (the
// sketch of 7 XI 2026): two sentences on top and one gain and one cost per option.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'agriculture_development');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_agriculture');
!}

= Modernisation of agriculture

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

The countryside needs better tools, consolidated fields and cooperatives of its own. The agrarian pressure now stands at [+ pl_gc_agrarian +] of 100.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @advisory
- @consolidation
- @cooperative_processing_sales
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@advisory
title: Send advisers and tools to the countryside
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month for four months. The agrarian pressure falls (−2), and the farms do better.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'agriculture_development', 'advisory').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_agriculture_development_advisory_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'agriculture_development', 'advisory');
!}
go-to: result

@consolidation
title: Consolidate the land
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month for four months. The agrarian pressure falls (−2), but the disputes over field borders first anger the peasants (+2).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'agriculture_development', 'consolidation').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_agriculture_development_consolidation_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'agriculture_development', 'consolidation');
!}
go-to: result

@cooperative_processing_sales
title: Support cooperative processing and sales
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month for four months. The peasants sell their crops better, but the middlemen and small traders trust us less (−3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'agriculture_development', 'cooperative_processing_sales').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_agriculture_development_cooperative_processing_sales_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'agriculture_development', 'cooperative_processing_sales');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Modernisation of agriculture

